1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,893
Haloarenes couple with sodium, just like the Wurtz reaction.

2
00:00:03,893 --> 00:00:12,330
Two chlorobenzene molecules with sodium in dry ether lose their chlorines to the sodium and join together, giving biphenyl.

3
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:14,101
This is the Fittig reaction.

